# Halo's campaign bodies as practice targets on Hang 'Em High: the Elite,
# the Grunt, the Jackal and the Marine each still at 5 m holding its gun
# (and at 2.5 m for the grip), the Jackal's arm shield up and then down,
# the Marine with an assault rifle and with a shotgun, and a Marine beside
# a Spartan for size (a scene script: chimera_client's `scene`; the bodies
# need their generated sets, `character/<id>`, game::campaign::unit).
#   cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox halo_ce:hangemhigh \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/halo_bodies_hangemhigh.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 1500                    # units in; the change of level's kill feed line (6 s) gone
halo_ce:body status
rung halo_ce:plasma_pistol   # a Halo gun in the player's hands
setpos -1150 3000 -770       # the first spawn's hall, down off its ledge
setang 2 342
wait 30
target add halo_ce:elite 5
wait 300                     # its held gun's textures in
shot elite_5m
target set all distance 2.5
wait 90
shot elite_2m5
target remove all
target add halo_ce:grunt 5
wait 300
shot grunt_5m
target set all distance 2.5
wait 90
shot grunt_2m5
target remove all
target add halo_ce:jackal 5
wait 300
shot jackal_5m_shield_up
target set all distance 2.5
wait 90
shot jackal_2m5_shield_up
halo_ce:body shield 0
wait 10
shot jackal_2m5_shield_down
target remove all
target add halo_ce:marine 5
target set all gun halo_ce:assault_rifle
wait 300
shot marine_ar_5m
target set all distance 2.5
wait 90
shot marine_ar_2m5
target set all gun halo_ce:shotgun
wait 300
shot marine_sg_2m5
target set all distance 5
wait 90
shot marine_sg_5m
target remove all
setang 2 347
target add halo_ce:marine 5
setang 2 337
target add halo_ce:spartan 5
target set all gun halo_ce:assault_rifle
setang 2 342
wait 300
shot marine_and_spartan
halo_ce:body status
target list
